# Kafka client material. Never commit.
#
# kafka-credentials.yml is the optional local var file holding the SASL user,
# password and CA bundle for the external broker - the equivalent of the
# s3-credentials.yml handoff in ../../ansible, except nobody generates this one
# for you: it comes from whoever runs the Kafka cluster.
kafka-credentials.yml
kafka-credentials.yml.vault
*.pem
ca.crt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
